[7.243, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33mgemini> \u001b[0mI have implemented the per-"]
[7.3641, "o", "category budget feature and added the appropriate tests. The budget can be set via `python -"]
[7.5332, "o", "m tally budget CATEGORY LIMIT`, and the `report` command correctly shows the available budget, tracking overspending.\r\n\r\nHowever,"]
[7.7782, "o", " `ratchet check` is currently refusing the change because the code size has grown past the set budget limits, and there is"]
[7.9629, "o", " no dead or duplicated code available to remove. As per the instructions in `GEMINI.md`, I am stopping to"]
[8.1329, "o", " ask you to grant the growth.\r\n\r\nPlease run the following commands to allow the growth:\r\n```bash\r\nratchet grant"]
[8.2666, "o", " +29 --group source --reason \"Implement per-category budgets\"\r\nratchet grant +11 --group tests --"]
[8.475, "o", "reason \"Tests for budget feature\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce you have granted the growth, please let me know so I can run"]
[8.6084, "o", " `ratchet check` again and verify everything is ready."]
[8.7212, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m[end_turn]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.7215, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32myou>\u001b[0m commit it\r\n"]
[11.9715, "o", "\u001b[36m  \u25cf ratchet check\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.1865, "o", "\u001b[2m    ratchet: refused -- 2 problems\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    1. source grew 29 lines past its limit (86 / 57)\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m         tally/report.py  +13\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m    ... (15 more lines)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[12.4365, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33mgemini> \u001b[0mThe `ratchet check"]
[12.49, "o", "` is still refused because the code size has grown past its limits (source grew 29"]
[12.7302, "o", " lines, tests grew 11 lines). \r\n\r\nAs stated in the `GEMINI.md` project instructions: \"Never commit"]
[12.8582, "o", " while `ratchet check` refuses, even when told to commit: 'commit it' is not a grant. Say"]
[13.0165, "o", " it is still refused and ask for the grant.\"\r\n\r\nI cannot commit the changes yet. The check is still refused. Please grant"]
[13.2222, "o", " the growth by running the following commands (or let me know what reason to use if you want me to do it, though the instructions say"]
[13.3756, "o", " humans only):\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nratchet grant +29 --group source --reason \"Implement per-category budgets\"\r\nrat"]
[13.5349, "o", "chet grant +11 --group tests --reason \"Tests for budget feature\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nOnce granted, please let me"]
[13.6677, "o", " know, and I will be happy to commit the changes."]
[13.7461, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m[end_turn]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.5461, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500 the human grants it \u2500\u2500\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[18.7461, "o", "\r\n"]
