[20.0162, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33mgemini> \u001b[0mI have verified that the budget"]
[20.1886, "o", " constraints pass (`ratchet check` returned `ok -- source 86/86, tests"]
[20.3161, "o", " 22/22`) and successfully committed the budget feature. \r\n\r\nThe commit includes:\r\n- Budget tracking"]
[20.4607, "o", " logic in `store.py` and `report.py`\r\n- The `budget` CLI command in `__main__.py"]
[20.6485, "o", "`\r\n- Tests for budget rendering in `test_report.py`\r\n- The updated `.ratchet.json` limits"]
[20.8098, "o", " and `.ratchet-grants.jsonl` grant file.\r\n\r\nLet me know if you need anything else!"]
[20.9485, "o", "\r\n\u001b[2m[end_turn]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
